---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Our Team Structure | Outsourced Accounting for UK Practices"
  description="A lean, accountable outsourced accounting team with a genuine second-person quality review built in. See who is working on your files."
>
  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Team Structure</p>
      <h1>A small team, and you know who does what</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Outsourcing only works if you know who is doing what. We are a small team and people cover
        more than one role. We'd rather say so than dress it up as a bigger department.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="split__head">
          <h2>Who works on your files</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="text-list">
          <div class="text-list__item">
            <h3>Engagement lead, team manager and senior accountants/bookkeepers</h3>
            <p>This group covers these functions between them: your single point of contact for the relationship, day-to-day oversight of deadlines, and the preparation work itself (bookkeeping, VAT, year-end accounts, tax computations) inside your existing systems.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-list__item">
            <h3>Junior accountants/bookkeepers and admin/company secretarial</h3>
            <p>Another group handles supporting preparation work alongside admin and company secretarial tasks, including AML screening and CDD/EDD file preparation for client onboarding.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-list__item">
            <h3>Quality review</h3>
            <p>A second, independent check on every file before it is sent to you. It is built into how the senior team reviews work.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-list__item">
            <h3>IT and data security lead</h3>
            <p>One dedicated senior IT engineer, full-time, responsible for our security infrastructure and protocols. They are also the point of contact for any data-handling questions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <CtaBand headline="Want to know who would work on your files?" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
